            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મેં ખેતરમાં બીજ વાવ્યાં. — mẽ khetarmā̃ bīj vāvyā̃ — \"I sowed seeds in the field.\""
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Not બીજું, second."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "બીજ (bīj) is Sanskrit bīja, \"seed\", taken over almost whole, a tatsama. The inherited forms of the same word are Gujarati bī and bīyũ, \"seed\" (CDIAL 9250)."
            }
